entory levels; and perform other duties as assigned. Will perform assigned operational duties in a scheduled area and will assist pharmacists in completing medication orders and related distribution duties in the assigned areas.","source_heading":"DESCRIPTION","source_subheading":null},{"item_type":"skill","requirement_level":"required","item_text":"Excellent communication, interpersonal and customer service and counseling skills,ability to operate computer systems.","source_heading":"MINIMUM QUALIFICATIONS","source_subheading":null},{"item_type":"skill","requirement_level":"required","item_text":"Proven teaching skills and writing skills, which can be applied to article publication in hospital newsletter and professional journal.","source_heading":"MINIMUM QUALIFICATIONS","source_subheading":null}],"pay":{"salary_min":35.25,"salary_max":null,"salary_period":"hour","annual_min":73320.0,"annual_max":73320.0,"annual_comparison":73320.0,"status":"usable","source":"scalar:hiring_pay_scale","source_heading":"hiring pay scale","source_text":"$35.25 / Hour","is_hourly_fte":true,"hours_per_unit":null},"published_at":"2026-10-15T15:18:52.778921+00:00"}
